  paragraphs: (
  [Why pay \$479 for a brand new pair of Bowflex adjustable dumbbells? As part of Amazon's Mega Spring Sale , Amazon Resale is offering a pair of used "like new" Bowflex Results Series SelectTech 552 Adjustable Dumbells for just \$227.99 with free shipping after an extra 40% off discount is applied during checkout . I haven't seen Bowflex dumbbells sell for this low of a price for at least a few years. You better hurry because Amazon Resale inventory is usually limited.],
